OL,3,GNEWSA'NHS team gave me hope when I was
OL,4,Aout of options'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man with a rare, life-threatening
OL,7,Fblood condition has become the first
OL,8,Fpatient in the UK to benefit from a new
OL,9,Ftreatment.
OL,11,FZehair Ayub, from Bradford, was
OL,12,Fdiagnosed with an arteriovenous
OL,13,Fmalformation (AVM) in 2011, which can
OL,14,Fdisrupt normal blood circulation and
OL,15,Fcause fatal bleeding.
OL,17,FThe AVM was deep in Zehair's brain and
OL,18,Fhad caused a large aneurysm, which was
OL,19,Fpressing on his visual nerves,
OL,20,Faffecting his sight.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
