OL,3,GNEWSA'NHS team gave me hope when I was
OL,4,Aout of options'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter 15 years of unsuccessful
OL,7,Ftreatments, he said he "took a chance"
OL,8,Fon the therapy, but "had complete
OL,9,Fconfidence in the team".
